WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.570
The date is 1969.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.410
The place is Japan in a period
of advanced economic growth.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.810
This is the story of those who protect
mankind from the grasp of invaders.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.510
This is the story
of the Gate Keepers.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.870
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:46.050
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.650
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.190
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:54.200
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.600
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.160
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:04.770
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:07.470
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:11.250
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.910
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:18.620
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.880
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:25.260
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:29.030
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.170
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:36.100
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.910
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.140
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:45.440
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:51.980
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.030
It looks like we
managed to retrieve it.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:09.400
Yes, sir!

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:11.340
Most important, is
the cargo unharmed?

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.030
Of course!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.370
All four machines are ready
to be assembled at any time.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.410
I see. It's finally time!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.300
This is Ukiya. Patrol complete.
Now returning to base.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.970
<i>Roger. Captain Ukiya
please return to base.</i>

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.770
Roger. What?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.670
Ooh!

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.750
That's a Lotus Seven!
You don't see those every day!

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.180
Why, you... Well,
you asked for it!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.850
It's fast. That's no ordinary Seven.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.460
I see! It's a Super Seven!

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.070
Shit!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.870
The real race has just begun!

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:01.110
Uh-oh.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:06.380
You two! Have you ever heard of
a thing called a speed limit?!

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.890
Yes, although it's more
like a speed UNlimit.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:13.150
What?! Y- You?!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.090
Long time no see, officer.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.500
Sorry about the trouble.

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:26.400
Yes, sir! Thank you, sir!

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:29.400
I believe I won this race.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.520
Here you are, sir.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.470
Hey, just a minute!

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.560
I'm sorry, but you need
to go through immigration.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.610
Do you understand Japanese?

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.140
My god!!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.180
I'm sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.520
Is my pronunciation of the
Japanese language all right?

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.170
Just a moment.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:16.330
Where did you come from?
I hope you're not a runaway.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:20.170
Tyranny. Interrogation without reason.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.980
What are you muttering about?
I can't hear you.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.590
Excuse my rude behavior!!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:35.190
Lack of self-consciousness...
Blind obedience to authority.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:43.990
I'm Jim Skylark from
the England branch.

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:47.190
You have the name of a racer.

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:49.210
I've heard of him!

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:52.240
He's the gate keeper
known as "Flying Scott."

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.180
Really.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.820
I'm from the North American branch.
My name is Jun Thunders.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.580
She's really pretty...

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.680
Yes, she looks like
a fashion model!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.960
Ikusawa, right now, are you thinking
she's fair competition for yourseif?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.620
Huh? Oh, please! I never
even gave that a thought.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:17.970
I... I'm from the German
branch. I'm Misao Sakimori.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.500
Oh, my! It's interesting that
someone who isn't German...

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.670
...is with the German branch.
Don't you think?

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:29.180
I've been in Germany
because of my father's work.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:35.050
Oh, I see. Still, for some reason
you remind me of Megumi.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.590
Everyone! Welcome to
the Far Eastern branch.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:48.830
Commander, I realize this is sudden,
but may I view your battle records?

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.390
Very well.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:16.260
It's similar to a type that
appeared in Los Angeles in 1967.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:20.290
Classification number ET-O6:
the iron bail formation.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.990
You practically haven't even
started to control your ability.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.690
This is terrible.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:52.900
What is it, Misao?

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:57.090
That looks similar to the invader
that destroyed the dam in France.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:08:00.360
The ET-11.This one
is also in our records.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.670
Dear, dear... not again.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:07.340
The release of gate-ability relying
on emotion... That's dangerous.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:11.350
Excuse me... At that point,
Ukiya had just awakened to his gate ability.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.180
But now, he's...

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.220
Now, he's what?

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:18.020
He's, uh... well...

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.680
Don't be hasty, please! Even if
Ukiya isn't used to fighting...

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:25.350
...l have been formally trained,
and I am watching him. So don't...

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.500
Formal training for what?
For a costume party?

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:39.740
That's not true. We are all
trying hard to fight...

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:42.410
...oh, my.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.680
Well, you certainly are
<i>trying</i> hard, at least.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.980
However, the results of your
battles are all that counts.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:51.250
This is probably the true merit
of the Far Eastern branch.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.760
Stop! Stop, stop, stop!!

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:57.160
Hold your comments until
you've seen ME in action!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:01.020
Ooh! Now there's a real man!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.430
Oh?

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.900
Here, here! Look at this!
Witness the power of...

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.900
...the Far Eastern branch's
pride: The gate engine!

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.770
No... I wasn't involved in that...

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.740
Look, look! I'm in my Sunday best!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.180
Well, I know you're cute, Fei, but...
Thanks, Bancho.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:16.440
...let's see some Bancho action!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.780
Wonderful... Too wonderful.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:27.580
And this time, Ukiya and I cooperated
to destroy the bullet train robot!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.750
Hm, that's impressive.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:31.920
Isn't it?!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.690
Yes, the power of the gate
engine sure is impressive!

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:35.930
What?!

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.800
Thanks to you, we were also able
to collect gate engine data.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.390
You were fine guinea pigs.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.630
That does it! One more word, and I'll...
Ukiya!

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.370
I'll what?

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.740
I'll throw you out of
the base, that's what!

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.850
That was the power
of my Gate of Speed.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:58.790
If you were not a member of the Far
Eastern branch, I would pulverize you.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:09:59.790
What?!

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:01.620
Challenging someone to a fight...

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:04.820
...before knowing what they're
capable of is foolhardy.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:09.030
"Know thine enemy and know thyself
to be ever-victorious."

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.030
Basic war strategy.

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:15.530
You can't hope to defeat those three
using such haphazard methods.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.430
Those three?

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.880
Akuma Hakushaku, the Kikai Shogun...

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.980
...and the evil gate keeper
code-named "Shadow."

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:30.410
Our orders from the New York
main headquarters of AEGIS are...

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:34.520
"join the Far Eastern branch to
stamp out enemy executives promptly."

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:37.490
lf that's the case, our
Gate Keeper team is capable...!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.660
Sorry to disappoint you,
but there's more.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:44.830
The Far Eastern Gate Keeper team will
only be present to assist us three.

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:49.510
That's baloney! There's no order
like that, right, Commander?

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.170
Commander?

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:53.900
It's the truth.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.310
That can't be!
I can't accept this!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.040
You're wasting your breath.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.880
Orders from New York
main H.Q. are absolute.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.390
In any event, you'll only be in
our way in your present condition.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:08.490
Oh, well! Sit this one out
and watch how we fight.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.630
If you'll excuse us, Commander.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.320
Yes...

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.830
This is too much!!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.870
Yes! Let's all appeal
directly to main headquarters!

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.840
That is a nice idea!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.070
I'll go to New York with you.

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.010
Me, too!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.070
Let's do it! It's okay
with you, right, Commander?!

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:38.510
Uh, so... Where's the
footage of me in action?

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.960
Everything seems to be in order.
It's all A-okay!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.560
What's that?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.400
Oh, uh, do you mean the Zero?

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:59.910
Why is this thing here?

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:02.040
Why. sir?

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.580
This is a pre-mass
production nightmare.

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:06.950
It's impossible to control.

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:11.280
Really? Still, it's been
assigned to the Far Eastern branch...

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.190
We don't need that piece of junk!

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:16.190
Just keep your mouth shut and
focus on finishing our machines.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.020
Yes, sir.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.190
Good.

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:26.300
It's hot!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.640
Why is it so hot?!

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:31.610
Because you're wearing
your winter uniform.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.970
I want to go swimming.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.270
I'm going to stripl!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.910
What are you d...?!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.570
I have my P.E. suit on underneath.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.120
Oh, I see.

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:47.550
I cannot forgive the heat, but that
Brit jerk is even more unforgivable!!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:52.930
I've fought long and hard as a gate
super, and that man insults me!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.460
Still, Bancho,
he may have a point.

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:57.970
What did you say?!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:02.370
Think about it. Lately, our
fights have been close wins.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:06.740
Maybe veterans are the
right people for the job.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.310
Maybe.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:12.080
What?! Not you, too,
Princess Kaoru?!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.740
I'm only in the Gate Keeper team...

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:18.450
...because I was influenced
by Ukiya's fighting.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:23.320
Their determination beats mine.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:25.620
If that's true,
that goes for me, too.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:30.030
I joined up only because I
wanted to be like a witch.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:32.330
I'm different!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:36.000
I'm here because I wanted to
make you realize I'm number one.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:40.010
You have more gate keeper
experience than any of us, Fei.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.100
You're confident, aren't you?

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.380
No, I'm not...

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.590
Hey...! What's wrong
with all of you?!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:59.290
Don't start whining over a
little criticism. Get it together!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.060
Okay... how about you, Rurippe?

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:04.030
Me?! I'm different!

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:07.000
I fight fully understanding
how important my duties are!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:10.200
That's why I decided to take
matters into my own hands...

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:12.710
...when you were acting
like a coward before!

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:15.510
Hey, don't call me a coward!

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:19.610
At any rate, if you seriously
believe they're right...

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:23.380
"Why don't YOU try to change?!
Why don't you try to improve?!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.560
I'm right, aren't l?!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.780
aren't l?!

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.790
Hey! Don't turn away from me!!!

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:35.300
Hi.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.090
What's all the commotion?

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:40.500
Kageyama...
There's no commotion.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:42.770
What are you doing here?
It's summer vacation.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.600
I have something to
do in the library.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:50.740
Let's see... "Capital System
Research,” "Science and Politics"...

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.940
Those books are all
kind of complicated.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:57.020
Not really. Reading about people
and the structure of society...

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.750
...is lot more interesting
than reading a sloppy novel.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.750
Kageyama!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.420
Hi, Aya. Well, let's go.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.430
Sure.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.020
" Let's go?" Don't tell me
you two are...?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.130
Oh, please. It's not like that.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.800
I plan to make a club for
the study of political thought.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.810
She's one of the members.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:23.140
Political Thought Club? You mean like the
type popular with student movements lately?

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:26.110
We won't do anything so radical.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:28.080
Sorry I'm late!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.140
Honestly! We've been
waiting fora while.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.210
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:35.920
I won't forgive you!
Well, see you later.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.400
Immoral sexual behavior under
the pretext of club activity...

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:47.660
...immoral! It's immoral
with a capital "l"!

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.410
Still, it looks like fun.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.810
That's true.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:57.680
Come on! We can't let them beat us! lf they
can make a club for political study...

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.680
...we can make a club
for Earth defense!

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.820
DREAM ISLAND

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.640
ls it a variation of the ET-19?

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:28.340
No, we've never seen this type.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.250
Oh, you're certainly late.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:34.840
Commander! It's the invaders, right?
Give us the order to move o...

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.550
We're moving out!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:40.850
Scramble immediately!
Fine by you, Commander?

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.060
Misao, are you ready?

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.520
<i>This is Sakimori.</i>

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:50.790
New-model gate engine loading
complete. Ready when you are.

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.200
Let's go.
Okay.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.040
Don't slow us down.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:16:59.840
Damn it!

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.890
The old model still has
a few miles left in it!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.730
OPEN THE GATE!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.570
Open the gate!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.300
Amazing!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:03.240
Are those...
...the new model...

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.770
gate engines?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.770
That's right. They are otherwise
called gate robots.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:12.540
This is Gate Robot One. Current gate
energy into engine influx is nominal.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:16.180
Robot Two: Idling normal,
voltage, oil pressure...

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.220
...gate pressure, all-green!

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:23.230
Robot Three. Observation instruments,
main computer, all functioning normally.

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.560
Commence annihilate operation!!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.780
This is too slow! Hyper-sonic!!

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.940
Let's do it!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:49.310
Damn!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.010
A blinding maneuver?

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:53.820
Jun! Give me support!

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:57.950
You got it! THUNDER...

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:01.000
...BOLT'!!

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:11.270
What do you think of the power
of the Gate of Lightning...

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:13.170
...amplified by my gate robot?

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.640
Don't waste your time.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:24.310
Misao! Calculate their future positions
with your Gate of Perception!

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:26.820
Roger. Gate of Perception...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.390
I see it. In 10 seconds...

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:41.200
<i>distance 7730 meters,
at 11:11 oklock.</i>

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:43.640
Roger! Engine full throttle!

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:47.910
Full acceleration, go!!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.040
Mach Seven!!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.430
So, it is the Kikai Shogun.

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.140
It's coming this way!

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:23.510
<i>Hey! Take shelter!</i>

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.510
But he'll get away!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.410
You idiot! Do you think
you're a match for him?!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.450
But still...

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:33.960
GATE OPEN!!

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:50.770
It can't be!

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.470
Look out!

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:04.050
Ukiya! lkusawa!!

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:22.460
She's awake!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.630
Ikusawa, are you all right?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.330
S- Sure...

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:30.240
That's right! Where's the enemy?
Where's the invader?!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.980
Oh.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:39.490
Why did you disobey my orders?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.490
I instructed you to run!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.550
Wait... It's my fault!

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:50.530
I acted without permission.
It's not his fault!

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.130
You're wrong!

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.640
Full responsibility lies with
the captain. I am responsible.

00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:58.130
I'm sorry.

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:00.910
<i>Ukiya...</i>

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:05.550
Oh, well. I'll let it go this time...

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:09.110
...because we at least managed
to give these a real field test.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:13.020
However! lf you disobey me again...

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:15.650
...l trust you know what will happen.

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:40.340
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:40.340 --> 00:22:44.200
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:49.180
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:49.710 --> 00:22:52.550
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.680
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.850
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:03.190
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:07.820
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:12.690
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:17.330
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:24.110
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
